WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:05.700
[grunting]

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.800
Monsieur Trepagny.

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:28.720
Duquet is gone.

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:32.532
Did you stay on the path?

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:33.366
No.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:51.751
What sort of a man are you?

00:00:51.818 --> 00:00:53.952
I don't know what you mean.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.089
Will you vouch
for Duquet or give

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:57.323
your word on his character?

00:00:57.390 --> 00:01:00.427
I take him here
to my [inaudible],,

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:03.696
show him the path to
becoming free, a landed man,

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:06.332
and now he has fled the
contract of his indenture,

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:09.202
leaving me to suspect
what lurks in your heart.

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:18.777
Will you flee or sink
your ax into my skull

00:01:18.845 --> 00:01:20.847
the moment I turn my back?

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.183
No, sir.

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:26.318
I will let you know if
you abandon our agreement

00:01:26.386 --> 00:01:31.024
like our compatriot Duquet, I
will weigh twofold on your hide

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:35.094
the fair and proper
punishment to your ilk.

00:01:35.161 --> 00:01:37.630
I'm a man of my word.

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:38.798
You had better be.

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:48.308
Now, tell me of the ram.

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:56.649
It is no coincidence that Duquet
took his leave after bringing

00:01:56.716 --> 00:01:58.318
that cursed ram here.

00:01:58.384 --> 00:01:59.786
Duquet said nothing to me.

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:10.163
Now I fear I have loosed
something into this world I

00:02:10.229 --> 00:02:12.631
will soon regret.

00:02:12.699 --> 00:02:13.700
Duquet?

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.201
TREPAGNY: Yes.

00:02:15.268 --> 00:02:19.005
A cunning creature who, if
he does not find his death,

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:25.178
will prosper as frog
to pond, rat to rot.

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:29.516
The clever Duquet will
find his place in Warwick.

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:30.917
Duquet is afraid of the woods.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:33.186
He will get lost and die.

00:02:33.253 --> 00:02:34.587
I'm sure of it.

00:02:34.654 --> 00:02:37.423
He will overcome that
fear because he is a rat,

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:41.961
and he will prosper with
these teeth and claws

00:02:42.028 --> 00:02:43.463
and never forebear it.

00:02:46.165 --> 00:02:48.201
I will search again tomorrow.

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:52.805
No.

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:55.975
You must return to your duties.

00:02:56.042 --> 00:03:06.152
Now, if I may avail myself of
your fire just for a moment.

